            may be seen as some kind of categorification of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/crossed+modules"} crossed modules
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} (
